        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259028460?u=76c93f0df0fbeb4706736acca78f07a43e398a63&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Consolidate the \"Nesting without subgrid\" example into a single CSS block.</li>\n<li>Move the complete <code class=\"notranslate\">.box1</code> definition into the remaining CSS block.</li>\n<li>Preserve the existing example behavior and HTML.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45295.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5231735950\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45295\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45295/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45295\">#45295</a></p>",
