        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is some tweaks to the docs added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5093056209\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45053\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45053/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45053\">#45053</a> as <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Elchi3/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Elchi3\">@Elchi3</a> spotted some issues when reviewing the BCD changes.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add's <code class=\"notranslate\">toJSON</code> methods. Note that <code class=\"notranslate\">PerformanceSoftNavigation</code>'s <code class=\"notranslate\">toJSON()</code> exists in Chrome's implementation but was missing from the spec (just added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5257824975\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WICG/soft-navigations/issues/91\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WICG/soft-navigations/pull/91/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WICG/soft-navigations/pull/91\">WICG/soft-navigations#91</a>) so is not yet in BCD.</li>\n<li>Removed <code class=\"notranslate\">navigationId</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">InteractionContentfulPaint</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">PerformanceSoftNavigation</code> and added it to <code class=\"notranslate\">PerformanceEntry</code> instead as it's an inherited property.</li>\n<li>Added to more docs.</li>\n<li>Marked where Performance APIs and properties were experimental.</li>\n<li>Added to the Performance SVG diagram and rejigged it a bit to correct some things. Not I also added the upcoming PerformanceContainerTiming while in there even though it's not yet documented elsewhere on MDN. Will add that to my todo list.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Correct docs.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related PRs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5093056209\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45053\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45053/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45053\">#45053</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5093054944\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30195\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30195/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30195\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30195</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5257051367\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30334\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30334/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30334\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30334</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5257824975\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WICG/soft-navigations/issues/91\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WICG/soft-navigations/pull/91/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WICG/soft-navigations/pull/91\">WICG/soft-navigations#91</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
