        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198354403?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removes an outdated example from the \"Supporting older browsers\" page that described <code class=\"notranslate\">subgrid</code> as recently supported and <code class=\"notranslate\">masonry</code> as experimental and unsupported.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The example had become inaccurate over time. Removing it keeps the browser compatibility guidance timeless and avoids requiring maintenance as feature support changes.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45318.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5254566959\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45318\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45318/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45318\">#45318</a></p>",
